## 3. Sprint 1 Plan

### Sprint Goal
> *"Deliver a working authentication system, role-based access control, and core book search functionality so that students can securely log in and search the library catalogue — forming the foundation of the SALAS MVP."*

**Sprint Duration:** 2 weeks (Week 1–2 of development)
**Sprint Velocity:** 18 story points
**Selected Stories:** US-002, US-010, US-013, US-001

| Story ID | Summary | Story Points |
|---|---|---|
| US-002 | Student registration and login | 3 |
| US-010 | Role-based access control | 3 |
| US-013 | AES-256 encryption + TLS | 2 |
| US-001 | Search library catalogue | 5 |
| **Total** | | **13** |

> Sprint 1 is intentionally conservative (13 of 18 available points) to account for project setup, environment configuration, and CI/CD pipeline establishment in the first sprint.

